  "whyTopTier": "The film's structure is typed into the product: Dia's command bar spells '3 small things to help solve your tab problems', numbered mono cards introduce each one, and every keyboard shortcut appears as large key caps in the corner while it's pressed. 48.4 s.",
  "instrument": "No camera moves at all (still 81%); every reframe is a cut.",
  "byEye": {
    "zoom": "the command bar at ×2; feature shots show the whole window at ×1 on a lavender wallpaper",
