  "classify": "Hand-edited feature list of real UI in full windows on a wallpaper. Conventions: typed premise, numbered chapter cards, key-cap overlays, a closing line and logo.",
  "diagnose": [
    {
      "observation": "Shortcuts are drawn as key caps in the corner.",
      "principle": "Make the invisible input visible: a keyboard action has no pointer to follow, so the film draws the keys."
    },
    {
      "observation": "The premise is typed into the product's own command bar.",
      "principle": "The medium carries the message, as in Claude's end card."
    },
    {
      "observation": "Numbered chapter cards.",
      "principle": "Signposting: the viewer knows how many beats are left, which buys patience for a 48 s film."
    }
  ],
